Cell["\<\
The partial derivative of signatory indirect utility wrt qn (qs at optimal) \
times the partial derivative of non-signatory effort wrt alpha\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9058161801281757`*^9, 3.905816197554556*^9}, {
