Cell["\<\
Under symmetry, we had two stability conditions and two indirect utility \
functions. Under asymmetry, we have 4 of them.
Self-interested non-signatory\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9060852729788637`*^9, {3.906085718993722*^9, 
   3.906085729602105*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c1372b2c-0721-49c1-bf5d-\
