Cell[TextData[StyleBox["1. eta = 0.5 and a = 5. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s start \
from the case where kr=ks=0 and check each type of country\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
incentives to become a signatory. \nks = 0 -> kr = 3 -> ks = 1 -> kr = 1 -> \
ks = 2 -> kr = 0 - > ks = 3 -> kr =0\nStable coalition: (ks*, kr*) = (3,0)\n\n\
2. eta = 0.2 and a = 5.\nks= 0 -> kr = 3 -> ks  =0.\nks = 1 -> kr =2 -> ks = \
1\nks = 2 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2\nks = 3 -> kr = 0 -> ks = 3\nStable Coalitions: \
(ks*, kr*) = {(0,3),(1,2),(2,1), (3,0)} \n\n3. eta = 0.8 and a = 5.\nks = 0 \
-> kr = 2 -> ks = 1 -> kr = 2\nks = 2 -> kr = 0 -> ks = 3 -> kr = 0\nStable \
Coalition: (ks*, kr*) = {(1, 2),(3, 0)}\n\n------\n4. eta = 0.5 and a = 8.\n\
ks = 0 -> kr = 2 -> ks = 1 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2 -> kr = 0 -> ks = 3, but there \
are no 3 self-interested.\nNo Stable Coalition\n\n5. eta = 0.2 and a = 8.\nks \
= 0 -> kr = 3 -> ks = 0\nks = 1 -> kr = 2 -> ks = 1\nks = 2 -> kr = 1 -> ks = \
2\nStable Coalitions: (ks*, kr*) = {(0,3),(1,2),(2,1)} \n\n6. eta = 0.8 and a \
= 8.\nks = 0 -> kr = 2 -> ks = 1 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2 -> kr = 0 -> ks = 3, but \
there are no 3 self-interested.\nNo Stable Coalition\n-----\n7. eta = 0.5 and \
a = 2.\nks = 0 -> kr = 2 -> ks = 1 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2 -> kr = 0 -> ks = 3, \
kr = 0.\nStable Coalition: (ks*, kr*) = (3,0) \n\n8. eta = 0.2 and a = 2.\nks \
= 0 -> kr = 3, but there are no 3 reciprocal.\nks = 1 -> kr = 2 -> ks = 1\nks \
= 2 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2\nks = 3 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 3\nStable Coalitions: (ks*, \
kr*) = {(1,2),(2,1),(3,0)} \n\n9. eta = 0.8 and a = 2.\nks = 0 -> kr = 2 -> \
ks = 1 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2 -> kr = 0 -> ks = 3 -> kr = 0\nStable Coalitions: \
(ks*, kr*) = {(3,0)} \n\nLet\[CloseCurlyQuote]s also analyze 1-3 under the \
assumption that alpha = 0.5.\n1a. eta = 0.5 and a = 5. \nks = 0 -> kr = 2 -> \
ks = 1 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2 -> kr = 0 - > ks = 3 -> kr =0\nStable coalition: \
(ks*, kr*) = (3,0)\n\n2a. eta = 0.2 and a = 5.\nks= 0 -> kr = 3 -> ks  =0.\n\
ks = 1 -> kr =2 -> ks = 1\nks = 2 -> kr = 1 -> ks = 2\nks = 3 -> kr = 0 -> ks \
= 3\n\nStable Coalitions: (ks*, kr*) = {(0,3),(1,2),(2,1), (3,0)} \n\n3a. eta \
= 0.8 and a = 5.\nks = 0 -> kr = 2 -> ks = 1 -> kr = 2\nks = 2 -> kr = 0 -> \
ks = 3 -> kr = 0\nStable Coalition: (ks*, kr*) = {(1, 2),(3, 0)}\n",
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->14]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8884970831688223`*^9, 3.888497118937248*^9}, {
